01:02:11.585 --> 01:02:15.043
<i>Hey man now you're really living</i>


01:02:15.422 --> 01:02:21.088
<i>Well I just saw the sun rise over the hill
Never used to give me much of a thrill</i>


01:02:21.661 --> 01:02:24.721
<i>But hey man now you're really living</i>


01:02:24.831 --> 01:02:28.631
Well, ladies, I believe
this is where we go our separate ways.


01:02:28.935 --> 01:02:30.402
Thank you.


01:02:33.974 --> 01:02:36.841
<i>People sing</i>


01:02:36.943 --> 01:02:39.673
<i>Do you know what it's like
to fall on the floor?</i>


01:02:39.913 --> 01:02:42.541
<i>And cry your guts out till you got no more</i>


01:02:42.916 --> 01:02:45.680
<i>Hey man now you're really living</i>


01:02:45.819 --> 01:02:46.979
Joy!


01:02:47.387 --> 01:02:48.615
Mason.


