- Well, yeah. Yeah.


01:02:54.628 --> 01:02:57.062
Brooklyn. The B.K. Love it here.


01:02:57.164 --> 01:02:58.722
Yeah, they're artists. Yeah.


01:02:58.832 --> 01:03:01.562
Hey, you want to go grab a glass of vino?
