01:03:01.701 --> 01:03:05.660
I can't right now. Sorry.


01:03:05.772 --> 01:03:09.765
- Okay, all right. Well, maybe next week.
- I have my retreat.


01:03:11.144 --> 01:03:12.202
Wow!


01:03:13.580 --> 01:03:15.707
You seem fine.


01:03:17.150 --> 01:03:20.745
No, I mean, you look great.
Doesn't she look great? You look great.


01:03:21.087 --> 01:03:22.554
