- Good.


01:05:04.124 --> 01:05:05.318
So let me get this straight.


01:05:05.425 --> 01:05:08.986
She asked you
to come to a retreat for her job.


01:05:09.095 --> 01:05:10.392
Yeah.


01:05:10.497 --> 01:05:13.398
The most important thing
to her in the world.


01:05:14.567 --> 01:05:17.161
Do you believe that? I was like, "No!"


01:05:19.205 --> 01:05:25.041
'Cause I'm like... I'm like,
"Hey, what are you still doing here?"


01:05:25.946 --> 01:05:28.881
Jack! You have got
to get your ass down there,


01:05:28.982 --> 01:05:31.610
