01:05:44.230 --> 01:05:49.395
Right? You tell her if she doesn't sign it,
you're gonna out her in front of everybody.


01:05:51.871 --> 01:05:52.929
Yeah.


01:05:54.908 --> 01:05:56.398
I mean, that's not, you know...


01:05:56.509 --> 01:05:58.602
It's not pretty, but we can...


01:05:59.245 --> 01:06:00.872
I can laminate it.


01:06:04.484 --> 01:06:08.352
- I don't know.
- Okay, look, Jack, the hearing's in a week.


01:06:08.455 --> 01:06:10.548
Okay? This is our last shot.


01:06:31.411 --> 01:06:33.504
