- Mr. Banger.


01:06:33.913 --> 01:06:35.141
So, where's this husband of yours?


01:06:35.248 --> 01:06:38.046
I just met Chonger's husband.
He's a very smart guy.


01:06:38.151 --> 01:06:40.210
He's a tool, but he's smart.


01:06:40.720 --> 01:06:42.051
He's...


01:06:44.357 --> 01:06:48.020
So the spaceman says,
"I don't even have a vagina!"


01:06:48.128 --> 01:06:49.459
He's there!


01:06:51.097 --> 01:06:53.156
