- Hey.


01:07:09.616 --> 01:07:10.605
I'm so glad to see you.


01:07:10.717 --> 01:07:12.378
Muffin, I've been looking
everywhere for you.


01:07:12.485 --> 01:07:15.886
This is why everyone
should have their wife on LoJack.


01:07:16.456 --> 01:07:19.425
Let me introduce you to my friends.
This is David Young, your CFO.


01:07:19.526 --> 01:07:21.494
Mr. Young. An honor. Hi.


01:07:21.761 --> 01:07:24.252
And this is the rest of your board, actually.


01:07:24.564 --> 01:07:27.465
Great people. Wealthy people.
Sit down, sit down, sit down.


01:07:29.736 --> 01:07:31.203
So you're the lucky guy.


01:07:31.304 --> 01:07:33.864
- Hi. Jack Fuller.
- I'm Richard Banger.


01:07:34.908 --> 01:07:36.569
You're in my seat.


01:07:37.710 --> 01:07:40.110
Wait, your name is Richard Banger?


01:07:40.613 --> 01:07:42.581
Your name is Dick Banger.


01:07:42.749 --> 01:07:44.512
Dick Banger! Dick Banger?


01:07:44.684 --> 01:07:48.643
You, sir, have just provided us with jokes
