01:07:51.858 --> 01:07:55.385
Well, you must be Jack... off!


01:07:55.495 --> 01:07:57.224
Jack-Off! Give it to me, baby!


01:07:57.330 --> 01:07:59.491
- Jack-Off, buddy!
- He has a comeback!


01:08:00.400 --> 01:08:02.334
McNally, where have you
been hiding this guy?


01:08:02.435 --> 01:08:04.232
You know, I've just been
keeping him all to myself!


01:08:04.337 --> 01:08:05.599
Well, you gotta learn how to share.


01:08:05.738 --> 01:08:09.834
All right, everybody, let's sit down.
Brainiac, Chonger, move over.


01:08:10.543 --> 01:08:13.910
"Jack-Off. " How about it? Oh, boy.


01:08:14.013 --> 01:08:18.245
I don't know what made you change
your mind, and I don't need to. I just...


01:08:18.351 --> 01:08:19.648
Thank you.


01:08:22.689 --> 01:08:25.590
- "Jack-Off. " I love that.
- Yeah, I do, too.


01:08:29.229 --> 01:08:32.756
I love that, that you said that.
Because it was...


01:08:34.367 --> 01:08:35.664
For a moment there, I...


01:08:35.768 --> 01:08:37.065
I'm so sorry.


01:08:37.904 --> 01:08:39.565
Joy, come on over! Joy!


01:08:41.040 --> 01:08:42.405
I'm on it!


01:08:43.409 --> 01:08:45.570
- Yeah!
- I'm on it.


01:08:48.381 --> 01:08:50.008
Yeah! Yeah!


01:08:53.987 --> 01:08:57.821
<i>One looks for happiness
One longs to find a partner</i>


01:08:57.957 --> 01:09:01.859
<i>One knows that nowadays
One love will be the answer</i>


01:09:03.663 --> 01:09:06.291
<i>One sees a crazy world
One needs a fresh perspective</i>


01:09:06.399 --> 01:09:08.060
- Hey.
- So what's up? She sign it yet?


01:09:08.168 --> 01:09:09.294
No, not yet.


01:09:09.402 --> 01:09:10.460
<i>You better not
be pussying out on me!</i>


01:09:10.570 --> 01:09:13.198
Don't get your panties in a bunch.
I'm just waiting for her to get down here.


01:09:13.439 --> 01:09:15.270
