these people up, you know?</i>


01:09:15.408 --> 01:09:17.501
All right, well, call me
when it's done, okay?


01:09:17.610 --> 01:09:18.804
I'm holding down the fort in the meantime.


01:09:18.912 --> 01:09:19.901
<i>- Yeah. All right.</i>
- Bye.


01:09:23.917 --> 01:09:25.145
Lavender.


01:09:26.386 --> 01:09:28.081
You get on my head.


01:09:30.757 --> 01:09:35.660
Oh, my God. That is slick.
That is something else.


01:10:10.096 --> 01:10:12.462
