- No.


01:10:14.667 --> 01:10:18.068
I guess I was wrong.
You do clean up pretty well.


01:10:22.208 --> 01:10:23.300
What?


01:10:24.911 --> 01:10:26.845
No, you just... You...


01:10:27.647 --> 01:10:29.672
I like your hair like that.


01:10:30.683 --> 01:10:31.843
