01:10:32.452 --> 01:10:34.215
Can I get two shots?


01:10:34.654 --> 01:10:36.417
You know what? Make it three.


01:10:36.522 --> 01:10:38.990
Hello, McNally.
Jack-Off, how are you doing?


01:10:40.460 --> 01:10:41.654
