01:10:47.567 --> 01:10:50.695
"Hello, my name is Joy's Bitch. "


01:10:53.172 --> 01:10:56.073
How's it going tonight?
You guys having fun?


01:10:57.243 --> 01:11:00.303
That's a good one, McNally.
I had no idea you were so much fun.


01:11:00.413 --> 01:11:01.607
