01:11:13.826 --> 01:11:17.284
- Unbelievable. Shocking.
- No, it's just... It's a party trick. It's not...


01:11:17.397 --> 01:11:18.728
I dare you.


01:11:25.538 --> 01:11:27.506
- I hate you.
- You love me.


01:11:30.476 --> 01:11:32.535
Very good! Very good!


01:11:32.645 --> 01:11:35.512
Terrific! You know,
had I seen this side of you before,


01:11:35.615 --> 01:11:38.846
