01:11:58.271 --> 01:11:59.795
Throw the dice.


01:12:00.740 --> 01:12:02.298
You've got this.


01:12:04.410 --> 01:12:06.037
- We need what, a seven?
- A seven!


01:12:06.179 --> 01:12:07.942
