- Throw a seven!


01:12:10.717 --> 01:12:11.843
Seven.


01:12:11.951 --> 01:12:13.316
Oh, my God!


01:12:13.653 --> 01:12:15.484
- Thank you. Thank you.
- You're welcome.


01:12:15.588 --> 01:12:17.852
We're done. Can we quit?
Can we quit? We're... Okay.


01:12:17.957 --> 01:12:19.083
Throw it in there.


01:12:19.192 --> 01:12:22.787
<i>Thank you. Ladies and gentlemen,
would you please gather round?</i>


01:12:23.963 --> 01:12:28.297
<i>Come on. Don't be afraid.
This year's Golden Handshake Award</i>


01:12:28.401 --> 01:12:31.700
<i>for best team spirit goes to a new face,</i>


01:12:32.372 --> 01:12:36.604
<i>and one of the funniest son of a bitches
I've ever had the pleasure to know.</i>


01:12:36.709 --> 01:12:38.870
<i>And I think you know
who I'm talking about.</i>


01:12:39.011 --> 01:12:44.074
- Jack-Off! Jack-Off! Jack-Off!
- Jack-Off! Jack-Off! Jack-Off!


01:12:44.183 --> 01:12:46.174
<i>Get up here! Come on!</i>


01:12:47.854 --> 01:12:50.152
<i>Congratulations, Jack-Off.</i>


01:12:52.125 --> 01:12:55.322
<i>Well, thank you all
for an amazing weekend. I...</i>


01:12:57.563 --> 01:12:59.724
<i>I have to thank my wife, Joy.</i>


01:13:04.871 --> 01:13:08.534
<i>She probably never told you all
the story about how we met.</i>


01:13:14.113 --> 01:13:17.139
<i>It might come as a surprise
to many of you</i>


01:13:17.884 --> 01:13:21.980
<i>that we didn't know each other
for very long before we got hitched.</i>


01:13:28.828 --> 01:13:31.490
<i>What can I say? You know?
When you know, you know.</i>


01:13:33.599 --> 01:13:37.831
<i>On our wedding night, we were so busy
running back to the honeymoon suite</i>


01:13:37.937 --> 01:13:42.567
<i>that we never really got a chance
to have a first dance.</i>


01:13:43.242 --> 01:13:44.300
<i>So...</i>


01:13:47.480 --> 01:13:48.777
<i>Ladies and gentlemen,</i>


01:13:48.881 --> 01:13:52.044
<i>for the first time,
Mr. and Mrs. Jack Fuller!</i>


01:13:59.592 --> 01:14:02.254
<i>First, when there's nothing</i>


01:14:03.129 --> 01:14:06.895
<i>but a slow glowing dream</i>


01:14:07.900 --> 01:14:10.425
<i>That your fear seems to hide...</i>


01:14:11.637 --> 01:14:13.332
You hear that?


01:14:13.439 --> 01:14:16.533
- They're clinking.
- Yeah. They are clinking.


01:14:17.410 --> 01:14:20.106
I think that means they want us to kiss.


01:14:20.346 --> 01:14:23.042
Well, if that's what the crowd wants...


01:14:23.883 --> 01:14:27.216
Yeah, but if you're not up for it,
you don't have to. It's fine.


01:14:27.320 --> 01:14:31.188
<i>In a world made of steel</i>


01:14:31.290 --> 01:14:34.953
<i>Made of stone</i>


01:14:39.098 --> 01:14:42.534
<i>Well, I hear the music</i>


01:14:42.635 --> 01:14:46.366
<i>Close my eyes, feel the rhythm</i>


01:14:46.806 --> 01:14:48.569
