01:15:01.821 --> 01:15:08.226
<i>I can't have it all
Now I'm dancing for my life</i>


01:15:09.495 --> 01:15:11.326
<i>Take your passion</i>


01:15:12.865 --> 01:15:16.028
<i>And make it happen</i>


01:15:27.079 --> 01:15:28.706
All right, look.


01:15:29.282 --> 01:15:32.410
When's the last time
you were, like, really happy?


01:15:32.518 --> 01:15:34.486
- Really happy?
- And don't say Vegas,


01:15:34.587 --> 01:15:37.920
because if you do, I'll just... I'll have to cry.


01:15:39.859 --> 01:15:40.917
Okay.


01:15:42.728 --> 01:15:44.593
There was this one day,


01:15:45.598 --> 01:15:47.998
before the Exchange, before Mason.


01:15:49.835 --> 01:15:53.862
I was feeling really adventurous,
so I took the ferry


01:15:53.973 --> 01:15:56.771
- about 30 miles east of the city.
- Mmm-hmm.


01:15:57.376 --> 01:15:59.105
There was this great lighthouse.


01:15:59.211 --> 01:16:02.806
I mean, it was just right on the beach,
off the boardwalk.


01:16:03.249 --> 01:16:05.240
- You went there by yourself?
- Yeah.


01:16:05.351 --> 01:16:08.081
You know, I just, like, sat on the beach,


01:16:09.188 --> 01:16:12.521
listened to the waves,
watched the sunset.


01:16:14.126 --> 01:16:18.586
God! I had no concerns, you know?
I had, like, no responsibilities,


01:16:18.698 --> 01:16:20.461
no job stressing me out.


01:16:20.566 --> 01:16:23.626
I had no one to please but myself.


01:16:24.704 --> 01:16:27.104
- That's that photo you have.
- Yeah.


01:16:28.441 --> 01:16:31.410
That was a great day.


01:16:48.694 --> 01:16:51.094
I did take myself out of the game.


01:16:57.036 --> 01:16:59.061
If you stop betting,


01:17:00.172 --> 01:17:02.037
you never have to lose.


01:17:15.488 --> 01:17:17.251
I'd bet on you, Jack.


01:17:31.370 --> 01:17:33.895
So, long day, huh?


01:17:34.507 --> 01:17:35.838
Yeah.


01:17:38.744 --> 01:17:41.611
So, we should probably get to bed.


01:17:43.749 --> 01:17:44.773
Yep.


01:18:04.804 --> 01:18:07.102
Can you undo my zipper?


01:18:07.740 --> 01:18:10.607
- It gets stuck.
- Yeah! Yeah.


01:18:11.510 --> 01:18:12.841
Absolutely.


01:18:18.050 --> 01:18:19.347
All right.


01:18:33.232 --> 01:18:35.393
All right. Okay. There it is.


01:18:40.372 --> 01:18:41.532
Thanks.


01:19:10.136 --> 01:19:12.331
Hey, I... These...


01:19:12.438 --> 01:19:15.999
- I wasn't in your things.
- It's okay. Just leave them right there.


01:19:16.108 --> 01:19:17.837
I can put them back.


01:19:23.849 --> 01:19:25.680
Good night, Mr. Fuller.


01:19:26.285 --> 01:19:28.150
Good night, Mrs. Fuller.


01:19:58.617 --> 01:19:59.914
<i>It's all right</i>


01:20:02.454 --> 01:20:03.421
<i>It's all right</i>


01:20:05.024 --> 01:20:06.355
<i>Everything's all right</i>


01:20:09.995 --> 01:20:11.189
<i>It's all right</i>


01:20:12.698 --> 01:20:14.563
<i>Everything's all right</i>


01:20:21.407 --> 01:20:22.374
<i>It's okay</i>


01:20:24.610 --> 01:20:27.807
Okay, I'm on my way. I know.


01:20:27.947 --> 01:20:29.414
It's almost over.
I'm about to be a free woman.


01:20:29.515 --> 01:20:32.109
- Joy. Joy!
- What?


01:20:33.419 --> 01:20:34.852
I have to go.


01:20:35.221 --> 01:20:36.654
- Mason?
- Yeah.


01:20:39.091 --> 01:20:42.492
I can't talk right now. I'm sorry.
I have to get going. I just...


01:20:42.595 --> 01:20:44.358
I want you back, Joy.


01:20:45.931 --> 01:20:48.695
- What?
- I made a huge mistake letting you go.


01:20:48.801 --> 01:20:50.393
I see that now.


01:20:50.536 --> 01:20:53.733
Seeing you the other day,
you had this glow about you.


01:20:53.839 --> 01:20:56.535
Not that you didn't before, it's just...


01:20:56.675 --> 01:20:58.768
Sometimes it takes losing something


01:20:58.878 --> 01:21:01.176
for you to realize what you had.


01:21:01.914 --> 01:21:04.815
I want to make up
for the wrong I did to you.


01:21:06.318 --> 01:21:07.785
This is yours.


01:21:08.454 --> 01:21:11.321
I gave it to you, and I want you to have it.


01:21:13.525 --> 01:21:15.891
- Where did you get this?
- And Joy,


01:21:17.663 --> 01:21:19.824
you are good enough for me.


01:21:32.077 --> 01:21:33.305
I mean that!


01:21:49.929 --> 01:21:51.920
Court is called to order.


01:21:52.798 --> 01:21:55.824
Well, lookie here, lookie here!
The happy couple!


01:21:55.935 --> 01:21:59.632
Six months down the road.
Did you learn anything?


01:22:00.272 --> 01:22:01.296
We'll see.


01:22:01.407 --> 01:22:04.501
Now, Dr. Twitchell, in your opinion,
did the couple,


01:22:04.610 --> 01:22:06.635
Jack Fuller and Joy McNally,


01:22:06.745 --> 01:22:09.407
obey the court order
to live together as man and wife,


01:22:09.515 --> 01:22:12.916
and do you believe they put
sufficient effort into the marriage?


01:22:17.957 --> 01:22:19.424
These two have


01:22:22.394 --> 01:22:23.952
a lot of issues.


01:22:24.430 --> 01:22:27.991
A lot of deeply unsettling issues


01:22:28.467 --> 01:22:31.800
that, as individuals,
they seriously need to work on.


01:22:32.838 --> 01:22:34.135
Seriously.


01:22:35.708 --> 01:22:38.506
But together, in my honest opinion,


01:22:39.945 --> 01:22:42.209
they're perfect for each other.


01:22:42.815 --> 01:22:44.043
It's the real thing.


01:22:45.017 --> 01:22:46.314
Go figure.


01:22:48.053 --> 01:22:50.886
Well, thank you, Doctor.
You may step down.


01:22:53.759 --> 01:22:55.021
Tipper!


01:23:02.234 --> 01:23:03.792
Hi, Your Honor.


01:23:04.670 --> 01:23:06.228
Have you lost weight?


01:23:08.340 --> 01:23:10.069
Gotcha. Let's begin.


01:23:10.709 --> 01:23:15.772
Although Ms. McNally ran up $25,000
in credit card debt in my client's name,


01:23:15.881 --> 01:23:18.543
my client recently spent the same amount


01:23:18.650 --> 01:23:21.551
for materials
for his new furniture business.


01:23:21.920 --> 01:23:24.946
Therefore, we propose
the following settlement, Your Honor.


01:23:25.224 --> 01:23:27.590
The original $3 million,
deduct half for taxes


01:23:27.693 --> 01:23:30.423
and $50,000 that's already been spent,


01:23:30.529 --> 01:23:33.464
that leaves $1.45 million to be divided...


01:23:38.470 --> 01:23:39.630
equally.


01:23:39.738 --> 01:23:43.606
Now that's the spirit!
You've learned to share! Do you accept?


01:23:50.315 --> 01:23:52.306
No, Your Honor, we do not.


01:23:53.519 --> 01:23:55.248
Gold-digging whore.


01:23:55.354 --> 01:23:59.256
My client has advised me that
she doesn't want any of the money.


01:24:00.225 --> 01:24:02.193
She just wants a divorce.


01:24:03.128 --> 01:24:05.187
Miss McNally, are you sure?


01:24:08.200 --> 01:24:09.724
Yes, Your Honor, I am.


01:24:09.835 --> 01:24:14.772
Well, then I hereby grant the divorce
and award all the monies to Mr. Fuller.


01:24:15.340 --> 01:24:17.069
Court adjourned.


01:24:22.681 --> 01:24:24.205
You win, Jack.


01:24:24.316 --> 01:24:26.784
I officially want nothing from you.


01:24:33.792 --> 01:24:35.316
Oh, my God.


01:24:35.427 --> 01:24:38.453
I won a case! Jesus Christ!


01:24:38.564 --> 01:24:40.555
Dude, we won!


01:24:40.833 --> 01:24:42.095
I won!


01:24:42.201 --> 01:24:44.931
Yeah! I'm the law, bitches!


01:24:45.037 --> 01:24:46.561
I'm a lawyer!


01:24:47.272 --> 01:24:48.466
To me!


01:24:49.274 --> 01:24:51.105
Anybody need a lawyer?


01:24:53.445 --> 01:24:55.538
<i>And tonight I have to leave it</i>


01:24:57.749 --> 01:24:59.580
Time heals all wounds.


01:25:01.386 --> 01:25:07.325
Now that you guys are officially done,
I was hoping to maybe get her number.


01:25:07.426 --> 01:25:09.394
<i>Yes, tonight I have to leave it</i>


01:25:11.530 --> 01:25:14.727
<i>Don't you come up to me
and say you like it</i>


01:25:14.833 --> 01:25:16.164
Yeah, okay.


01:25:16.635 --> 01:25:19.297
You don't have to answer that right now.


01:25:23.408 --> 01:25:25.501
Hey, I have a question.


01:25:26.745 --> 01:25:28.770
How much does an island cost?


01:25:29.081 --> 01:25:30.878
<i>And tonight I have to leave it</i>


01:25:32.084 --> 01:25:34.416
<i>Yes, tonight I have to leave it</i>


01:25:36.989 --> 01:25:40.015
Now we come to the final item
on our agenda.


01:25:41.994 --> 01:25:43.962
Congratulations, McNally.


01:25:46.765 --> 01:25:49.325
Thank you, sir. I won't let you down.


01:25:55.307 --> 01:25:58.242
Okay, I think I'm gonna have to
let you down.


01:25:58.343 --> 01:26:00.811
Why don't you just give it to Chong,
you know?


01:26:00.913 --> 01:26:02.312
She's good, she deserves it,


01:26:02.414 --> 01:26:04.882
and besides,
I think she just enjoys being miserable.


01:26:05.317 --> 01:26:07.444
- Yes!
- You sure you know what you're doing?


01:26:07.553 --> 01:26:10.488
No, I don't. But I think that's the point.


01:26:11.823 --> 01:26:14.417
I would rather do nothing and be happy


01:26:15.327 --> 01:26:17.852
than do something that I don't love.


01:26:30.909 --> 01:26:32.706
Well, I lost her at happy.


01:26:32.811 --> 01:26:34.506
I don't know what the hell
she was trying to say anyway.


01:26:34.613 --> 01:26:37.241
Well done, Chonger. The job is yours.


01:26:40.919 --> 01:26:42.181
Thank you.


01:26:43.021 --> 01:26:44.852
So! Jack made a piece of furniture.


01:26:45.891 --> 01:26:47.290
He finished it.


01:26:47.392 --> 01:26:49.019
Okay. Go ahead, Dad.
What's wrong with it?


01:26:49.127 --> 01:26:50.594
Nothing. It's good.


01:26:50.696 --> 01:26:52.960
It's really good. I'm proud of you.


01:26:56.134 --> 01:26:57.328
- Thank you.
- But...


01:26:57.436 --> 01:26:58.403
Here we go.


01:26:58.503 --> 01:27:00.061
...you royally screwed up
when it comes to that girl.


01:27:00.172 --> 01:27:03.938
It was a big, stupid mistake. Okay?
The entire marriage was a lie!


01:27:04.042 --> 01:27:06.567
The marriage might have been a mistake,
but it was not a lie.


01:27:06.678 --> 01:27:09.442
And I think that anybody
who has spent time with you two recently


01:27:09.548 --> 01:27:10.640
could tell you that.


01:27:10.749 --> 01:27:13.877
So why don't you get your head
out of your ass


01:27:13.986 --> 01:27:16.147
and go do something about it?


01:27:16.788 --> 01:27:20.121
Or should I tell you not to,
and then maybe you will?


01:27:23.462 --> 01:27:26.124
She's gone, man.
- Gone? What do you mean, gone?


01:27:26.231 --> 01:27:30.531
She, like, lost it. She quit her job,
shut off her phone. She took off.


01:27:30.802 --> 01:27:32.793
Look, I don't really care much for you,


01:27:32.904 --> 01:27:34.701
and I want to cut your friend Hater.
Seriously.


01:27:34.806 --> 01:27:36.034
But for some reason,


01:27:36.141 --> 01:27:39.076
you're, like, the only man
that Joy can actually be herself with,


01:27:39.177 --> 01:27:43.113
so I wanna tell you where she is,
I really do. I just don't know.


01:27:43.782 --> 01:27:45.750
- What do you know?
- I don't know. If you were miserable


01:27:45.851 --> 01:27:49.287
and you wanted to get happy again,
where would you go?


01:27:51.089 --> 01:27:52.147
What?


01:27:53.925 --> 01:27:55.222
Thank you.


01:27:58.497 --> 01:28:00.795
Okay, tell you what. We both go.


01:28:01.133 --> 01:28:02.327
That way, when she sees us both,


01:28:02.434 --> 01:28:04.925
she can make up her mind
on who she wants to be with.


01:28:05.037 --> 01:28:08.905
I've loaned you my band saw,
I've loaned you my beer tap.


01:28:09.007 --> 01:28:10.531
Do you even know
how to drive an automatic?


01:28:10.642 --> 01:28:12.303
The keys. Give me the keys.


01:28:12.411 --> 01:28:13.776
Here. Sorry.


01:28:14.579 --> 01:28:16.945
Go get your future ex-ex-wife.


01:28:26.191 --> 01:28:29.957
<i>What a waste of time
The thought crossed my mind</i>


01:28:30.062 --> 01:28:32.895
<i>But I never missed a beat</i>


01:28:33.432 --> 01:28:37.368
<i>Can't explain the who or what I was</i>


01:28:37.769 --> 01:28:40.294
<i>Trying to believe</i>


01:28:40.672 --> 01:28:42.765
<i>What would you do?</i>


01:28:44.476 --> 01:28:47.673
<i>What would you do?
Do you know?</i>


01:28:48.180 --> 01:28:51.672
<i>I once had a grip on everything</i>


01:28:51.783 --> 01:28:54.946
<i>It feels better to let go</i>


01:28:55.220 --> 01:28:57.586
<i>I'm not over</i>


01:28:58.924 --> 01:29:02.451
<i>I'm not over you just yet</i>


01:29:02.561 --> 01:29:04.927
<i>Cannot hide it</i>


01:29:06.198 --> 01:29:09.865
<i>You're not that easy to forget</i>


01:29:10.068 --> 01:29:13.128
<i>I'm not over</i>


01:29:17.175 --> 01:29:19.666
<i>I'm not over</i>


01:29:43.101 --> 01:29:44.466
You found me.


01:29:46.471 --> 01:29:48.234
You left this behind,


01:29:49.541 --> 01:29:53.341
and I wanted to bring it back to you.


01:29:58.850 --> 01:30:02.684
Do you know how many lighthouses
there are 30 miles east of the city?


01:30:02.788 --> 01:30:04.517
- How many?
- Five.


01:30:04.623 --> 01:30:07.490
- Really?
- Yeah, just in case you're wondering.


01:30:07.592 --> 01:30:08.581
So.


01:30:09.828 --> 01:30:15.357
Did you come all the way out here
just to give this back to me?


01:30:16.368 --> 01:30:19.030
I did. So I'm going to get out of here.


01:30:21.940 --> 01:30:23.771
All right. Here it is.


01:30:24.776 --> 01:30:27.336
When we were married, I was horrible.


01:30:28.146 --> 01:30:30.740
Sick. Just wrong.


01:30:32.984 --> 01:30:35.544
And it's the best time I've ever had.


01:30:39.257 --> 01:30:41.555
You bet on me, Joy,


01:30:44.196 --> 01:30:46.790
and you made me want to bet on myself.


01:30:47.265 --> 01:30:50.496
So don't think about anyone else


01:30:51.036 --> 01:30:54.005
and just answer this for you.


01:31:02.781 --> 01:31:05.079
Do you want to be married to me?


01:31:06.184 --> 01:31:07.310
Again?


01:31:09.955 --> 01:31:11.183
You know,


01:31:12.591 --> 01:31:15.719
for so long, I've just...
I've tried to please everybody.


01:31:16.228 --> 01:31:19.288
And by not trying to please you,


01:31:21.967 --> 01:31:24.162
I think I became myself again.


01:31:27.405 --> 01:31:28.429
I do


01:31:29.608 --> 01:31:33.442
want to be married to you again.


01:31:59.938 --> 01:32:01.371
I quit my job.


01:32:02.641 --> 01:32:03.835
I heard.


01:32:04.109 --> 01:32:07.510
I have absolutely no idea
what I'm going to do. No clue.


01:32:07.612 --> 01:32:12.242
Well, it's a good thing that I have...
That we have a ton of money.


01:32:12.350 --> 01:32:13.977
Oh, my God!


01:32:15.487 --> 01:32:18.923
That's right. We hit the jackpot.


01:32:19.724 --> 01:32:21.089
Yeah, I did.


01:32:26.164 --> 01:32:29.031
Now, Joy, do you take this young man


01:32:30.235 --> 01:32:34.797
