- That was it! Oh, my God!


01:32:49.020 --> 01:32:50.749
You may kiss the bride.


01:32:52.791 --> 01:32:54.418
This is the greatest day of my life!


01:32:54.926 --> 01:32:58.521
- This is the greatest day of my...
- What? What?


01:33:00.432 --> 01:33:01.524
Oh, my...


01:33:01.766 --> 01:33:03.256
This is marvelous, simply marvelous.


01:33:03.368 --> 01:33:05.359
- Bye! Thank you!
- Bye-bye.


01:33:05.503 --> 01:33:07.198
Have fun, you guys!


01:33:07.305 --> 01:33:08.932
It's so much fun in there!
You guys are gonna love it!


01:33:09.040 --> 01:33:11.133
Woman!
- Holy shit.


01:33:11.242 --> 01:33:13.233
Woman!
