<i>I could pretend</i>


01:35:45.363 --> 01:35:49.561
<i>Can't you understand
I hate you my friend</i>


01:35:51.636 --> 01:35:54.230
<i>I hate you my friend</i>


01:35:55.707 --> 01:35:58.198
<i>I hate you my friend</i>


01:38:20.652 --> 01:38:24.088
What are you doing later? You know,
there's a meteor shower tonight.


01:38:24.188 --> 01:38:25.621
You know what?


01:38:25.723 --> 01:38:28.317
Jack was our glue.


01:38:28.426 --> 01:38:30.826
I feel like the fact that he's gone
